// A `repeat percent` whose body is THREE bars or longer repeats as one slash and then
// BLANK bars (LilyPond prints nothing in them — lily/percent-repeat-iterator.cc emits a
// single RepeatSlashEvent for the whole body). The collector fills those blank bars with
// spacer rests; the notation staff never drew them, but until 2026-09-02 the tab arm of
// the renderer had no `IsSpacer` gate and printed a WHOLE REST in each blank bar (owner's
// Billie Jean bassTab book, bars 8-10 / 12-14). Both staves here must show bars 4-6 as
// slash + blank + blank. The `r1` in bar 7 is the positive control: a REAL whole rest
// still prints on both staves.
octave absolute
time 4/4

part bl {
  clef bass
  tuning bass
  section A {
    repeat percent 2 { a,,8\4 a,,\4 a,,\4 a,,\4 c\1 c\1 c\1 c\1 | d,4\3 d,\3 d,\3 d,\3 | g,2\2 g,\2 | }
    r1 |
  }
}

form main { A }

score main "tab-percent-blank-bars" {
  staff bl
  tab bl as full
}
